OL,3,GNEWSA'People use AI to avoid paying for
OL,4,Aschool photos, but they don't realise
OL,5,Athe consequences'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA photographer is warning parents who
OL,8,Fuse artificial intelligence to take the
OL,9,Fwatermark off school pictures about the
OL,10,Fdangers of how companies can use images
OL,11,Fof their children.
OL,13,FIan Gilbert, founder of Emotion Picture
OL,14,FPhotography, said he had heard parents
OL,15,Fboasting at the school gates about how
OL,16,Fthey use the tool to avoid paying for
OL,17,Fphotos.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
