OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'People use AI to avoid paying for
OL,4,Aschool photos, but they don't realise
OL,5,Athe consequences'
OL,6,
OL,7,F"The scary thing is when you submit a
OL,8,Fpicture to AI by default it is allowed
OL,9,Fto do whatever it wants and I don't
OL,10,Fthink a lot of parents realise that,"
OL,11,Fhe said.
OL,13,FAn AI safety expert said he understood
OL,14,Fwhy people did it, and that it may seem
OL,15,Fharmless, but uploading any
OL,16,Fidentifiable information, including
OL,17,Fphotographs, was "not worth the risk".
